  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gezira Fruit Juice Blending Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Fruit juice, Town/City: Juba, South Sudan, Summary: The project will enable Gezira Young People Agribusiness Trust to scale up and professionalize its fruit juice business through improved assets and working capital. Members will be trained in entrepreneurship, agronomy, good governance, and financial management, and funds will be provided for improved processing equipment and the construction of a new juice shop. The expected impacts are GYPATs increased ability to purchase fruits from farmers, increased sales due to improved quality of products and marketing efforts, as well as the enhancement of the associations organizational capacity. These achievements will lead to significant improvements in the living standards and economic prosperity of members and the host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
